/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (Analysed Puma India footwear listings to understand how the catalog is priced and mixed across product types, genders and price segments. Covered which product types lead by volume and by price, how products spread across budget, mid and premium ranges, whether colour options relate to price, and which products are the most expensive. Cleaned the data in Excel, analysed it with SQL \(PostgreSQL\) and visualised it in Power BI.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
